  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/308f9b3f-f045-401f-8dbf-77da376bc526-9895364.PNG\" style=\"width: 360px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p>Let initial velocity of bullet be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math>.</p><p>Given, mass of bullet&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;and mass of ball&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>,</p><p>Initially ball is at height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;at rest, the only acceleration acting is due to gravity.</p><p>Time of flight of each ball and bullet is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>.</p><p>Now, velocity of ball and bullet as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>120</mn><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>As the collision is elastic, so applying conservation of linear momentum.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mi>g</mi></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>120</mn><msqrt><mi>g</mi></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>360</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
